# Cenvyro CRM webhook — the lead form's /api/contact function forwards leads here.
# Server-only secret: keep it WITHOUT a PUBLIC_ prefix so it never reaches the browser.
# Copy this file to `.env` for `vercel dev`, and set the same variable in the Vercel
# project's Environment Variables. Do NOT commit the real .env file.
CENVYRO_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-cenvyro-webhook-url-here
